{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0122","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:0000012b:text","row":22541,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"「太一ー」","en":"“Taichiii!”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002812","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00001","en":"Tomoki: \"Taichi!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:0000014d:text","row":22542,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"廊下を歩いていると、呼び止められた。","en":"Someone called after me as I walked down the hall.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002813","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00002","en":"I walk down the corridor when I'm stopped by a call.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","tense_aspect"],"assessment":"The passive phrase is unidiomatic, and the present tense disrupts the source's completed event. The source says someone called out and stopped him as he walked down the hall.","remedy":"Use 'As I walked down the hall, someone called out and stopped me.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":51,"start":0,"text":"I walk down the corridor when I'm stopped by a call"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:00000191:text","row":22543,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"「お、まだいたの？」","en":"“Oh. You’re still here?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002814","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00003","en":"Taichi: \"Oh, you're still around?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:00000243:text","row":22544,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"「そっちこそ」","en":"“Look who’s talking.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002815","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00004","en":"Tomoki: \"Same back at you.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:00000269:text","row":22545,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"友貴の顔が能面のようだった。","en":"Tomoki’s face was as blank as a Noh mask.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002816","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00005","en":"Tomoki's face was like a noh mask.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:0000029d:text","row":22546,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"微妙な距離を置いて、ふたり。","en":"The two of us stood an awkward distance apart.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002817","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00006","en":"It's a complex distance that they keep, these two.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","mistranslation"],"assessment":"The English is syntactically awkward and misreads the source's delicate or awkward interpersonal distance as a complex measurable distance.","remedy":"Use 'The two of us keep an awkward distance between us.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":49,"start":0,"text":"It's a complex distance that they keep, these two"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:000002d9:text","row":22547,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"「部活だったんだよ」","en":"“Club stuff.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002818","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00007","en":"Taichi: \"I was at club 's all.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar"],"assessment":"The clipped copular phrase is malformed even for colloquial speech. The source casually says he was at club activities.","remedy":"Use 'I was at club, that's all.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":29,"start":18,"text":"club 's all"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:0000030d:text","row":22548,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"「最近部活に出てる」","en":"“I’ve actually been showing up lately.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002819","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00008","en":"Taichi: \"I've been going to club activities lately.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:000003bf:text","row":22549,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"「……どうしてまた？」","en":"“...Why now?”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002820","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00009","en":"Tomoki: \"...why again?\"","verdict":"questionable","categories":["mistranslation","tense_aspect"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:000003f5:text","row":22550,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「いや、目的があっていいじゃないか」","en":"“Hey, nothing wrong with having a purpose.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002821","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00010","en":"Taichi: \"Nah, it's just, isn't it nice to be gunning for something?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:00000456:text","row":22551,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"「部活って、例の与太話？」","en":"“By ‘club,’ you mean that crackpot scheme?”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002822","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00011","en":"Tomoki: \"Club activities, you mean that garbage?\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["register_voice","word_choice"],"assessment":"The source calls it a tall tale or absurd nonsense. 'Garbage' is a harsher value judgment and loses the sense that Tomoki doubts the story's truth.","remedy":"Use 'that tall tale' or 'that nonsense.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":47,"start":40,"text":"garbage"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:00000488:text","row":22552,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"群青学院放送局の開局。","en":"Launching the Gunjo Academy Broadcasting Station.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002823","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00012","en":"The inauguration of the Gunjou Institute Broadcast Department.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","name_address"],"assessment":"The source names the opening of the academy's broadcasting station. The English changes the institution from an academy station to an institute department.","remedy":"Use 'the launch of the Gunjou Academy Broadcasting Station.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":61,"start":24,"text":"Gunjou Institute Broadcast Department"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:000004be:text","row":22553,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「与太じゃないよ、たぶん」","en":"“It’s not a crackpot scheme. Probably.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002824","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00013","en":"Taichi: \"That wasn't garbage, maybe.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["tense_aspect"],"assessment":"The source rejects the label in the present: it is not nonsense, probably. The English past tense makes the status sound concluded.","remedy":"Use 'It's not garbage. Probably.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":28,"start":14,"text":"wasn't garbage"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:00000576:text","row":22554,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「太一がそういうことするのは……なんか、まあ、理由あってのことだろうけど」","en":"“You getting involved in something like that... Well, I guess you must have your reasons.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002825","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00014","en":"Tomoki: \"Well, if you're doing that, Taichi... then, well, there's gotta be a reason or something I guess.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:0000065e:text","row":22555,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"「他に誰が参加してんの？」","en":"“Who else is in it?”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002826","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00015","en":"Tomoki: \"Who's else's participating?\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar"],"assessment":"The interrogative and possessive endings are incorrectly combined.","remedy":"Use 'Who else is participating?'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":21,"start":9,"text":"Who's else's"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:00000698:text","row":22556,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"「部長」","en":"“The president.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002827","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00016","en":"Taichi: \"The Prez.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:0000073e:text","row":22557,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"「……だけ？」","en":"“...That’s all?”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002828","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00017","en":"Tomoki: \"...that's it?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:0000076c:text","row":22558,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「そう」","en":"“Yep.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002829","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00018","en":"Taichi: \"Yep.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:00000812:text","row":22559,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「それ部活じゃない……」","en":"“That isn’t a club...”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002830","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00019","en":"Tomoki: \"That ain't a club...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:0000084a:text","row":22560,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「部活と思えば自慰だって部活だ」","en":"“Anything’s a club activity if you say it is. Jerking off included.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002831","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00020","en":"Taichi: \"If I think it's club then even 'self-consolation' is club.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["undertranslation","register_voice"],"assessment":"The source explicitly says masturbation for a crude joke about what can count as a club activity. The euphemism blunts the joke and changes the speaker's register.","remedy":"Use the source's explicit term.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":57,"start":41,"text":"self-consolation"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:00000908:text","row":22561,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「……最近、いろいろと動いてるのは知ってたけど、部活とはね」","en":"“...I knew you’d been busy lately, but I never guessed it was for a club.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002832","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00021","en":"Tomoki: \"...I only knew there's been moving about here and there of late, so it was about club.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","mistranslation","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The sentence is incoherent and reverses the discovery. The source says Tomoki knew Taichi had been active lately but had not realized those activities were for a club.","remedy":"Use 'I knew you'd been busy with things lately, but I didn't realize it was club activity.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":94,"start":12,"text":"I only knew there's been moving about here and there of late, so it was about club"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:0000095c:text","row":22562,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"肩をすくめた。","en":"He shrugged.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002833","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00022","en":"I shrugged my shoulders.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:0000098a:text","row":22563,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「そっちこそ。今なにやってんだ？」","en":"“And you? What’ve you been doing?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002834","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00023","en":"Taichi: \"Well, back to you again. Whatcha doing now?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:00000a4a:text","row":22564,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「部活」","en":"“Club.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002835","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00024","en":"Tomoki: \"Club.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:00000a72:text","row":22565,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"「わはは」","en":"“Ha ha ha!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002836","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00025","en":"Taichi: \"Wahahah!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:00000a9c:text","row":22566,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「……え、意味わからん？」","en":"“...What, you don’t get it?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002837","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00026","en":"Taichi: \"...eh, but I don't get it?\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["wrong_subject","mistranslation"],"assessment":"In context, Taichi asks whether Tomoki did not understand his joke. The English instead has Taichi declare that he himself does not understand.","remedy":"Use 'What, you don't get it?'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":34,"start":20,"text":"I don't get it"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:00000b54:text","row":22567,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"「本物の部活」","en":"“A real club.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002838","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00027","en":"Tomoki: \"Real club activities.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:00000c00:text","row":22568,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「暇だったら参加してくれよな」","en":"“If you’re bored, come join us sometime.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002839","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00028","en":"Tomoki: \"If you're free, come participate.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:00000c3e:text","row":22569,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"「そりゃいいけど……」","en":"“Sure, but...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002840","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00029","en":"Taichi: \"Well, see, it's...\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["omission","mistranslation"],"assessment":"The source concedes that joining would be fine before trailing into a reservation. The English omits that agreement and leaves a different filler fragment.","remedy":"Use 'Sure, that's fine, but...'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":24,"start":9,"text":"Well, see, it's"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:00000cf7:text","row":22570,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"「……裏切られるぞ」","en":"“...You’re going to be betrayed.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002841","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00030","en":"Tomoki: \"...you'll be betrayed.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:00000d23:text","row":22571,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"ぽつ、と言う。","en":"He murmured it.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002842","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00031","en":"Fragmentary, to say.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","mistranslation"],"assessment":"The English is not a sentence and does not convey that Tomoki says the warning quietly or abruptly in a small, isolated utterance.","remedy":"Use 'He says it quietly.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":19,"start":0,"text":"Fragmentary, to say"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:00000d51:text","row":22572,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「誰に？」","en":"“By who?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002843","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00032","en":"Taichi: \"By who?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:00000d98:text","row":22573,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"「部長に」","en":"“The president.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002844","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00033","en":"Tomoki: \"The President.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:00000dd4:text","row":22574,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「なぜ？」","en":"“Why?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002845","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00034","en":"Taichi: \"Why?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:00000e1b:text","row":22575,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"「だから、あまり親しくしない方がいい」","en":"“That’s why you shouldn’t get too close to her.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002846","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00035","en":"Tomoki: \"And that's why you'd better not get too close to her.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:00000f11:text","row":22576,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"背を向けて、友貴は立ち去る。","en":"Tomoki turned and walked away.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002847","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00036","en":"Turning his back to me, Tomoki departs.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:00000f45:text","row":22577,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"様子が変だったな。","en":"That was strange.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002848","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00037","en":"Quite an odd behavior we had here.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["wrong_subject","grammar"],"assessment":"The source says Tomoki was acting strangely. The English turns the observation into shared behavior by 'we' and is ungrammatical.","remedy":"Use 'He was acting strangely.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":33,"start":0,"text":"Quite an odd behavior we had here"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0122:00000f6f:text","row":22578,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"どうしたんだろう？","en":"What had gotten into him?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:002849","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0018:00038","en":"What could've happened?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
